        "text_F83JAK": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our tantalizing tonics are crafted in the hedonistic spirit of the original party god, Dionysus.<\/p><p>Dionysus, revered as “DIO” on the heavenly peaks of Mount Olympus, has been theimmortal hand composing the most splendid soirees throughout history. Son of Zeus,the almighty king of gods, and a mortal woman, DIO temptingly fuses the mortaland the divine, turning the fruits of the earthly realm into potions so potent thateven Aphrodite swoons. <\/p><p>A god whose sole purpose is pleasure, DIO is known for hisability to create the most exquisite elixirs and awaken even the most imperial spiritsfrom the prude slumber of everyday life. A nectar of the gods, one sip is like settingablaze the spitfire soul of Hades after a long humdrum hibernation.<\/p><p>A half-mortal, DIO has a particular fondness for the spoils of the mortal realm... andof course, the mortals within it. Seeking to seduce those who roam this earthly realmin pursuit of pleasure, he comes bearing gifts: a line of celestially canned cocktails fitfor a god to inspire a world of spectacular soirees and decadent delights.<\/p><p>Raise a glass in honor of Dionysus and #drinkdivinity.<\/p>",
            "text_style": "tw-font-quote tw-text-2xl",
            "alignment": "tw-text-left"
          }
        }
