        "text_h9egFA": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Humble host. Indulgent innovator. Acclaimed author. Creative council to the celebrity soiree. Anyone who’s heard of Bronson van Wyck is unsurprised by his latest venture. Every devilish detail of his infamous parties is designed to create an experience and define a mood. <\/p><p>His talent has drawn clients including Madonna, Gwyneth Paltrow, Swizz Beatz & Alicia Keys and many more. If you haven’t had the chance to attend one of his events, you’re always invited to slide your fingers across the cover of his book “Born to Party, Forced to Work” and flip your way into his universe. <\/p><p>Rooted in his belief that a delectable cocktail unlocks connection and conversation, the co-founder of DIO is offering a twist on timeless classics for elevated entertainment.<\/p>",
